WEBVTT

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:25.567
We, the 11 Valkyries, have gathered here

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:30.405
at the order of our eldest sister,
Brünnhilde.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.284
My sisters!

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:40.040
What is it you're planning, my sisters?

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.541
Brünnhilde.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:45.045
Come hither, Randgriz.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.340
Yes, Brünnhilde.

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:56.473
RANDGRIZ, FOURTH OF THE 13 VALKYRIE

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:58.767
Randgriz!

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:06.399
Randgriz, you know of
Thor's sacred items, do you not?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.735
Yes, indeed I do.

00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:15.158
The iron gloves which can fend off
any attack, Járngreipr.

00:01:16.826 --> 00:01:17.952
And most importantly,

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:22.457
there is Mjölnir, which gained fame
for obliterating the Jötunn army.

00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:29.172
That's right. Those two weapons
which Thor possesses

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.258
are the dirtiest cheats
of all the sacred items in the heavens.

00:01:32.342 --> 00:01:34.177
"Dirtiest…"

00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:39.766
In order to defeat Thor,
those must be overcome.

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:45.605
Randgriz, will you dedicate
your body for this purpose?

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.776
Yes, I gladly will, Brünnhilde.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:54.531
What? "Dedicate your body"?

00:03:25.997 --> 00:03:30.919
KILLER MOVE

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.930
What's going on?

00:03:42.931 --> 00:03:45.934
Lü Bu's halberd has begun to glow!

00:03:47.352 --> 00:03:49.687
Yes, just as I figured.

00:03:49.771 --> 00:03:51.105
That weapon…

00:03:51.189 --> 00:03:52.440
Could it be…

00:03:52.941 --> 00:03:54.192
Interesting.

00:03:54.692 --> 00:03:57.362
-Isn't that…
-You can't be serious!

00:03:57.987 --> 00:04:03.034
That itself is the hidden power
of us Valkyrie.

00:04:03.618 --> 00:04:06.371
To defeat the dirty cheats
the gods use for weapons,

00:04:06.454 --> 00:04:08.164
we have our own cheat!

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:10.333
Transcendence!

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:16.130
When a Valkyrie's body transforms
into a weapon for humans,

00:04:16.214 --> 00:04:20.551
mankind obtains a weapon of the gods,
in other words, a sacred item.

00:04:20.635 --> 00:04:22.178
That ability is called…

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:34.816
Divine Treasure Forge!

00:04:47.245 --> 00:04:48.246
Völundr!

00:05:13.646 --> 00:05:17.442
An unbreakable foe
and an unbreakable weapon!

00:05:20.028 --> 00:05:22.113
That kind of world…

00:05:24.449 --> 00:05:26.117
is the greatest!

00:05:27.201 --> 00:05:30.621
The special abilities of the 13 Valkyrie

00:05:30.705 --> 00:05:32.790
dwell in the weapons made through Völundr.

00:05:35.168 --> 00:05:37.253
The fourth sister is Randgriz.

00:05:37.754 --> 00:05:39.672
The meaning of her name is…

00:05:41.674 --> 00:05:43.634
"Shield Breaker"!

00:05:44.218 --> 00:05:48.222
Mjölnir is a powerful weapon of the gods
that can crush continents.

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:51.225
However, anyone who wields
its immense power

00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:55.688
and intense lava-like heat
will be annihilated.

00:05:56.898 --> 00:06:00.401
Therefore, according to Edda,
the story of Norse mythology,

00:06:00.485 --> 00:06:05.031
Thor wears Járngreipr
to protect his hands.

00:06:06.949 --> 00:06:08.576
In other words,

00:06:08.659 --> 00:06:11.245
the greatest armor
in the heavens, Járngreipr,

00:06:11.329 --> 00:06:14.457
is used to handle the greatest weapon
in the heavens, Mjölnir.

00:06:20.296 --> 00:06:23.299
This spectacle was something
that never should have happened.

00:06:25.134 --> 00:06:26.719
Randgriz!

00:06:27.303 --> 00:06:31.224
The sacred item was shattered?

00:06:31.307 --> 00:06:35.394
Lü Bu's halberd shattered Járngreipr
into tiny bits

00:06:35.478 --> 00:06:38.356
as if it were a potato chip!

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:41.109
-Excellent!
-All right!

00:06:41.192 --> 00:06:43.611
Did you see that, you gods?

00:06:43.694 --> 00:06:48.074
Lü Bu is the greatest
of our Three Kingdoms era!

00:06:49.075 --> 00:06:50.827
I bet you're trembling in fear now!

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:03.840
Zhang Fei, this is nothing
for you to boast about.

00:07:06.217 --> 00:07:08.886
At least, I'd like to say that.

00:07:10.555 --> 00:07:14.016
But as one who knew him
and lived in the same era as him,

00:07:15.226 --> 00:07:19.230
I cannot deny
that it brings me great honor.

00:07:20.481 --> 00:07:22.483
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:07:22.984 --> 00:07:24.902
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:07:24.986 --> 00:07:27.155
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:29.490
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:07:29.574 --> 00:07:31.576
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:07:31.659 --> 00:07:33.286
-Huzzah!
-Huzzah!

00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:35.496
Lord Lü Bu!

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.958
-Lord Lü Bu!
-Lord Lü Bu!

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:43.337
My lord!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.132
You are magnificent!

00:07:47.341 --> 00:07:48.634
My lord!

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:51.888
Well done!

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:55.266
You look like you're enjoying it so much!

00:07:57.602 --> 00:07:59.020
I, Chen Gong,

00:07:59.687 --> 00:08:03.191
am glad that I accompanied you to heaven!

00:08:13.201 --> 00:08:14.702
Awesome!

00:08:14.785 --> 00:08:16.829
That dude is totally badass!

00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:18.456
This is incredible!

00:08:18.539 --> 00:08:19.874
Damn, he's strong.

00:08:20.458 --> 00:08:23.461
All of mankind trembled with anticipation.

00:08:24.462 --> 00:08:26.631
Since history began… Nay!

00:08:26.714 --> 00:08:28.841
Since the birth of primitive mankind,

00:08:28.925 --> 00:08:31.719
they have anticipated the first time
they surpass the gods!

00:08:33.054 --> 00:08:35.139
They anticipated a miracle!

00:08:39.227 --> 00:08:40.353
I see.

00:08:40.853 --> 00:08:42.897
So that's what it is.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:45.650
Oh, you've caught on, haven't you?

00:08:46.234 --> 00:08:48.152
The Valkyries' job is…

00:08:49.153 --> 00:08:51.155
to guide souls to heaven.

00:08:51.864 --> 00:08:53.199
They descend to Earth

00:08:53.282 --> 00:08:57.161
and guide the souls
of the greatest humans to heaven

00:08:57.745 --> 00:09:01.749
to be the soldiers of the gods
and protect the heavens from any crisis.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.254
However, since ancient times,
there has been this rumor.

00:09:07.255 --> 00:09:11.259
What the Valkyries are preparing for
is not a crisis in the heavens.

00:09:11.759 --> 00:09:13.678
Though this is only a rumor,

00:09:13.761 --> 00:09:16.931
it is said that the Valkyries
transform themselves into weapons

00:09:17.014 --> 00:09:21.269
appropriate for the soldiers
that they guided to heaven.

00:09:21.769 --> 00:09:24.105
They offer up their bodies and powers

00:09:24.188 --> 00:09:26.315
which are equal to those of the gods.

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.572
The name of that power is…

00:09:34.365 --> 00:09:35.199
Völundr!

00:09:36.117 --> 00:09:39.078
The souls of the warriors
the Valkyries have gathered…

00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:47.461
will battle the gods using the powers
they received from the Valkyries.

00:09:47.545 --> 00:09:51.966
And that's what
this Ragnarok is all about, isn't it?

00:09:56.387 --> 00:09:57.513
Yes!

00:09:57.597 --> 00:09:59.432
That's exactly right!

00:09:59.515 --> 00:10:04.437
It's those cunning vixens' rebellion
against us gods!

00:10:08.816 --> 00:10:10.693
Who…

00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:17.700
who would have thought those Valkyries
would seriously cross swords with us?

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:21.537
This is…

00:10:22.079 --> 00:10:24.498
the biggest thrill I've had…

00:10:25.791 --> 00:10:27.209
since the Big Bang!

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:35.092
I'm so turned on!

00:10:36.886 --> 00:10:38.054
Yes!

00:10:38.846 --> 00:10:44.018
Brünnhilde…

00:10:47.647 --> 00:10:51.484
Brünnhilde!

00:10:51.567 --> 00:10:55.154
Don't look this way, you dirty old geezer.

00:11:01.994 --> 00:11:04.664
What the heck is that?

00:11:04.747 --> 00:11:05.915
What happened?

00:11:13.506 --> 00:11:16.717
Brünnhilde, what is that?

00:11:28.938 --> 00:11:32.441
Is Mjölnir crumbling apart?

00:11:33.567 --> 00:11:34.443
Oh, dear…

00:11:34.527 --> 00:11:38.406
The orichalcum is melting
and turning into lava!

00:11:39.448 --> 00:11:41.784
This is incredible!

00:11:43.119 --> 00:11:46.163
It's just as searingly hot
as in the legends!

00:11:46.247 --> 00:11:47.873
But why did this suddenly happen?

00:11:48.666 --> 00:11:55.131
However, now that Thor has lost one of
the Járngreipr gloves like in the legends,

00:11:55.214 --> 00:11:58.968
will he be able to wield Mjölnir
with both hands?

00:12:00.469 --> 00:12:04.140
You mean he can't use the Thor Hammer?

00:12:04.223 --> 00:12:05.391
You're kidding!

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:17.278
What's that sound?

00:12:23.868 --> 00:12:26.162
Is it a drum?

00:12:29.665 --> 00:12:30.708
No!

00:12:31.417 --> 00:12:33.461
Unbelievable!

00:12:34.879 --> 00:12:38.716
It's the throbbing of Mjölnir!

00:12:46.807 --> 00:12:49.727
At last, you've awoken.

00:13:07.953 --> 00:13:10.414
It's pulsating!

00:13:10.998 --> 00:13:14.001
What is that? Some kind of living thing?

00:13:14.084 --> 00:13:17.004
It's so weird! Yikes!

00:13:19.548 --> 00:13:22.426
Looks like Mjölnir has finally woken up.

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.887
Woken up?

00:13:25.888 --> 00:13:26.931
That's odd.

00:13:28.891 --> 00:13:35.022
There is one misunderstanding about
the legend of Mjölnir and Járngreipr.

00:13:36.106 --> 00:13:37.942
A misunderstanding?

00:13:38.526 --> 00:13:40.319
Those gloves

00:13:40.402 --> 00:13:45.699
are not to protect Thor
from the power of Mjölnir.

00:13:45.783 --> 00:13:47.201
Then what are they for?

00:13:47.284 --> 00:13:51.705
They exist to restrain Thor's power

00:13:51.789 --> 00:13:58.045
to prevent him from crushing Mjölnir
before it awakens.

00:14:29.076 --> 00:14:30.744
Such a sleepyhead.

00:14:41.547 --> 00:14:43.090
He lifted it.

00:14:43.173 --> 00:14:44.466
Amazing!

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.843
Wow!

00:14:46.427 --> 00:14:48.178
Incredible!

00:14:48.262 --> 00:14:52.057
Human… No. Lü Bu, was it?

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:54.435
I have a favor to ask you.

00:15:05.321 --> 00:15:06.822
Don't die.

00:15:12.578 --> 00:15:15.873
The human, Lü Bu,
has finally inspired Thor

00:15:15.956 --> 00:15:19.251
to get totally serious!

00:15:22.004 --> 00:15:24.381
How will this turn out?

00:15:24.465 --> 00:15:27.760
This bout has now entered the red zone

00:15:27.843 --> 00:15:31.221
where even the gods don't know
what the result will be!

00:15:36.977 --> 00:15:40.564
Hey, Brünnhilde! That's against the rules!

00:15:41.231 --> 00:15:44.652
You're supposed to turn off your phone!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.628
Brünnhilde?

00:16:04.588 --> 00:16:05.798
I know it now.

00:16:07.633 --> 00:16:10.177
The list of all the competitors

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.555
in the final battle
between god and man, Ragnarok.

00:16:16.266 --> 00:16:19.812
This… is it?

00:16:20.396 --> 00:16:21.563
HEAVEN

00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:24.066
ZEUS, BUDDHA, LOKI, APOLLO
POSEIDON, SUSANOO NO MIKOTO

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:27.569
QIN SHI HUANG, KING LEONIDAS, NIKOLA TESLA
KOJIRO SASAKI, JACK THE RIPPER, ADAM

00:16:28.654 --> 00:16:31.073
HERCULES, THOR, VAIŚRAVAA, ANUBIS
ODIN, BEELZEBUB, SHIVA

00:16:32.157 --> 00:16:36.370
These 13 bouts will decide everything.

00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:46.422
This is the countdown
to the extermination of mankind.

00:16:47.965 --> 00:16:52.636
For mankind,
these people are the final 13!

00:16:55.097 --> 00:16:56.348
The final?

00:16:58.017 --> 00:16:59.184
You're wrong, Göll.

00:17:00.811 --> 00:17:05.858
One day, we warriors
are sure to be called…

00:17:07.192 --> 00:17:09.445
the 13 god slayers!

00:17:09.987 --> 00:17:11.739
The Einherjar!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.119
The representatives of mankind…

00:17:17.202 --> 00:17:19.955
Einherjar!

00:17:26.462 --> 00:17:27.671
Zeus,

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:31.633
we now know who
the human combatants will be.

00:17:31.717 --> 00:17:34.136
Really? Let me see that.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:37.890
Well, well.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:45.022
This is far more exciting
than I expected it would be.

00:17:57.576 --> 00:17:59.661
Here it comes, folks!

00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:03.415
In the first bout of the final battle
between god and man, Ragnarok,

00:18:03.499 --> 00:18:06.001
on which the destruction of mankind rests,

00:18:06.502 --> 00:18:09.588
the battle between the god of thunder,
Thor, and the warrior, Lü Bu,

00:18:09.671 --> 00:18:12.007
has entered its final stage

00:18:12.091 --> 00:18:17.387
now that Thor has shifted into high gear!

00:18:24.937 --> 00:18:25.896
My lord!

00:18:25.979 --> 00:18:29.066
Really? Thor's getting serious, isn't he?

00:18:29.149 --> 00:18:30.859
I've never seen this before.

00:18:30.943 --> 00:18:32.611
I haven't either.

00:18:38.742 --> 00:18:42.162
The awakened Mjölnir,
swung with all of Thor's might.

00:18:42.746 --> 00:18:47.751
It would be the first time
even the omniscient gods would see it.

00:18:49.002 --> 00:18:50.337
Don't die.

00:19:12.568 --> 00:19:13.944
According to Snorri's Edda

00:19:14.027 --> 00:19:18.073
written by the Icelandic poet,
Snorri Sturluson,

00:19:18.949 --> 00:19:21.326
Thor threw Mjölnir

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:25.664
and crushed the skulls
of the frost giants, the Jötunn.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.793
Due to Mjölnir's mystical power,

00:19:29.877 --> 00:19:33.255
it has never missed once in 100 throws.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.792
I can't keep up with the action!

00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:13.462
Lü Bu dodged the hammer that never misses

00:20:13.545 --> 00:20:15.672
and is charging the defenseless Thor!

00:20:22.512 --> 00:20:24.932
Wait! Mjölnir has returned!

00:20:26.183 --> 00:20:28.227
It's attacking Lü Bu from behind!

00:20:34.024 --> 00:20:37.861
The spinning attack of Mjölnir
was sidestepped with a spin!

00:20:39.238 --> 00:20:41.323
Mjölnir is returning to Thor!

00:20:47.788 --> 00:20:50.582
There is more to the Edda
than was recorded.

00:20:52.334 --> 00:20:57.464
The true purpose that Thor threw Mjölnir
was not to attack with.

00:20:58.257 --> 00:21:02.386
He would use the immense velocity
and centrifugal force

00:21:02.469 --> 00:21:07.391
from throwing Mjölnir with all his might
to deliver the ultimate blow!

00:21:10.143 --> 00:21:11.436
Lü Bu!

00:21:14.773 --> 00:21:16.191
No! Is he…

00:21:17.776 --> 00:21:20.237
Several thousand years ago

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.739
when he battled his archenemy Jörmungandr…

00:21:22.823 --> 00:21:26.702
…it's the same attack he used
just once in that fight!

00:21:37.838 --> 00:21:40.048
Geirröd Thor's Hammer!

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:45.220
When Thor displayed the finest smile
he'd shown in this bout,

00:21:46.096 --> 00:21:49.808
Lü Bu met it with his most maniacal smile.

00:23:29.908 --> 00:23:34.913
Subtitle translation by: Brian Athey
